menu "Rabbit protocol (rbx)"

    config RBX_MAX_BOX_CLIENTS
        int "Max box clients per transport"
        range 1 8
        default 4
        help
            Simultaneous Rabbit 2 / Rabbit Connect clients the box server accepts (TCP), and UDP
            clients it remembers.

    config RBX_MAX_PILOTS
        int "Max pilot screens (pilot server)"
        range 1 8
        default 4

    config RBX_TASK_STACK
        int "Task stack size"
        default 4096

    config RBX_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "Task priority"
        range 1 24
        default 5

    config RBX_LEGACY_AUTO_PILOT
        bool "Legacy rb_start(): also subscribe as pilot to whoever connects"
        default n
        help
            With the legacy rb.h API, rb_start() starts rbx_link instead of the plain box server: when
            Rabbit 2 connects to the box it also receives Rabbit's computed data (rbx_link_pilot()).
            Needs UDP port 7532 free.

endmenu
